:: UC2 {"position":"1725,625","size":"100,100"}
The web-tool successfully achieves the required accessibility features. However, the company now needs time to recover from the costs of maintaining two versions simultaneously. This outcome frustrates shareholders, and funding decreases further due to the earlier misallocation of resources.

<div style="text-align: center;">
<img style="width:200px; height:200px;"
src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/6770/6770528.png">
</div>

[[Next->Outcome4]]


:: UC3 {"position":"1725,775","size":"100,100"}
The web-tool fails to comply with accessibility standards, triggering backlash that damages AllTogether’s reputation and causes financial loss. As a result, users lose confidence in the product and begin turning to competitors.

<div style="text-align: center;">
